msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANG.ANNOUNCE.TEACH_RECIPE_INTERRUPTED"
msgid "Just a moment... No quitting halfway... What are you doing?"
msgstr "稍等……没有半途而废的道理……搞莫子……"

