msgstr "日拱一卒，功不唐捐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANG.ANNOUNCE.WANG_LEARNED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANG.ANNOUNCE.WANG_LEARNED"
