msgstr "拈子剑"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANG.NIANZI_SWORD_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANG.NIANZI_SWORD_DESC"
msgid "He is simply used to placing a stone before things happen."
msgstr "他只是习惯在事情发生之前，先落下一子。"

